Error [jet.InvalidSchedule]: This daily schedule's hour is out of range
  --> tests/ui/schedule_bad_wallclock_range.jet:2:14
    |
  2 | #[Job, Every("25:00")] prune_sessions: fn() {
    |              ^^^^^^^
 Why: 24h wall-clock hours run `00`..=`23`.
 Fix: Write an hour between `00` and `23`, e.g. `#Every("03:00")`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0926
